{"author": "careerwithvasanth", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2025-02-20-top-free-ai-mock-interview-tools-you-must-try-in-2025-iggkmk-61e01dee86:u000015"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "method", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [{"citations": [{"quote": "So first thing I'll make sure like I have the right project and folder setup.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-02-20-top-free-ai-mock-interview-tools-you-must-try-in-2025-iggkmk-61e01dee86:u000015"}], "text": "Set up the right project and folder."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "second I make sure I write the reusable components, reusable functions and components that are really required for the project.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-02-20-top-free-ai-mock-interview-tools-you-must-try-in-2025-iggkmk-61e01dee86:u000015"}], "text": "Write reusable components and functions required for the project."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "Third thing I make sure all the security aspects are taken care.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-02-20-top-free-ai-mock-interview-tools-you-must-try-in-2025-iggkmk-61e01dee86:u000015"}], "text": "Ensure all security aspects are covered."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "Fourth I make sure performance is taken care.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-02-20-top-free-ai-mock-interview-tools-you-must-try-in-2025-iggkmk-61e01dee86:u000015"}], "text": "Ensure that performance considerations are handled."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "Fifth I make sure there is no tech theft.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2025-02-20-top-free-ai-mock-interview-tools-you-must-try-in-2025-iggkmk-61e01dee86:u000015"}], "text": "Ensure that there is no tech theft."}], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "So first thing I'll make sure like I have the right project and folder setup. And second I make sure I write the reusable components, reusable functions and components that are really required for the project. Third thing I make sure all the security aspects are taken 